{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_46","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"tail -10 references.bib; tail -12 claims_grounding.json; tail -18 REPRODUCIBILITY.md; head -30 references_provenance.json; cat reference_consultation.md.prov.json; cat paper.pdf.prov.json; ls -l figures/*overview*; rg -n 'year empty|empty year|FUNCTION \\\\{.*year|format.date' paper.bst\"","aggregated_output":" doi = {10.1007/s10994-009-5152-4}\n}\n\n@misc{Brier1950,\n title = {VERIFICATION OF FORECASTS EXPRESSED IN TERMS OF PROBABILITY},\n author = {Glenn W. Brier},\n year = {1950},\n howpublished = {Monthly Weather Review},\n doi = {10.1175/1520-0493(1950)078<0001:VOFEIT>2.0.CO;2}\n}\n      \"source_ids\": [\"result.top_program_01\"],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\"@evidence[[source_evidence/selected_method.py#L336-L365]]\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Prior permitted work covers representative anchors, efficient benchmark score estimation, sparse ability-based benchmarks, reference-instance assessors and learned evaluation acquisition. These citations provide context, not performance measurements for this study.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\"ref.openalex.W4411630215\", \"ref.openalex.W4392181972\", \"ref.openalex.W4406058560\", \"ref.openalex.W4403556531\", \"ref.openalex.W4403344243\"],\n      \"citation_keys\": [\"Vivek2024\", \"Polo2024\", \"Kipnis2025\", \"Pacchiardi2024\", \"Li2025\"],\n      \"grounding_note\": \"Permitted exact-DOI metadata and abstracts were inspected; see reference_consultation.md. No citation-graph traversal or prohibited-source identification was used.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n## References and access restriction\n\nThe supplied bibliography contained unrelated retrieval hits; they were discarded. Exact permitted starter DOI/arXiv identifiers and classical methodology DOIs were queried without broad literature search, citation-graph traversal or identification of the prohibited unnamed paper. Semantic Scholar exact-ID requests returned HTTP 429; OpenAlex exact-DOI retrieval was used as the documented fallback. `reference_consultation.md` records the returned metadata/abstracts that were inspected. Where no abstract was returned, citations provide bibliographic context only, not claims about uninspected experiments. A mistaken classical DOI returning an unrelated historical statistics title was rejected and replaced with the verified equivalence-of-design-problems citation. No prohibited source was identified or deliberately accessed; no citation graph or upstream research code repository was read during this paper step. The task's explicitly permitted starter references were used within their stated scope.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython .codex/skills/validate-paper/scripts/validate_tex_refs.py --tex paper.tex --bib references.bib\npython .codex/skills/write-paper-standalone/scripts/validate_claims.py --paper-data paper_data.json --references references_provenance.json --bib references.bib --claims claims_grounding.json --paper-dir .\nbash .codex/skills/scientific-evidence/scripts/scientific_evidence.sh verify --root-dir .\n/tmp/paper-venv/bin/python verify_paper_artifacts.py\npython .codex/skills/validate-paper/scripts/validate_rendered_si.py --pdf paper.pdf\n```\n\nThe local verifier checks actual JSON-pointer paths, manifest schema, numerical reaggregation, figure paths, standalone language, rendered references/Supplementary Information ordering, body-page count and geometric last-page fill. The base scientific-evidence verifier reports unsupported locator grammars as anchored; the local pointer checks supplement it.\n\nTwo canonical wrapper limitations are documented, not hidden: `validate_figures.py` cannot import the absent `src.orchestrator` package, and the compile recorder rejects `/usr/share/texmf/web2c/texmf.cnf` because its standard symlink resolves into a different approved TeX root. Direct no-shell-escape pdfLaTeX/BibTeX compilation and rendered Supplementary Information validation succeed. Figure schema/readability and body-layout checks are performed locally; the parent orchestrator must rerun its complete checks after replacing the overview placeholder. These wrapper errors are not scientific qualification diagnostics.\n{\n  \"campaign_results_dir\": \"work/results/t07/codex/20261113_154315/investigation\",\n  \"count\": 25,\n  \"generated_at\": \"2026-11-13T18:27:39.477580+00:00\",\n  \"queries\": [\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2309.08638\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2402.14992\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2407.12844\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2409.03563\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2410.05952\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2211.09110\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.48550/arXiv.2406.01574\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1080/00401706.1970.10488634\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1214/aoms/1177729442\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.4153/CJM-1960-030-4\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1111/j.2517-6161.1970.tb00842.x\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1111/j.2517-6161.1977.tb01600.x\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1007/978-0-387-84858-7\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1007/978-0-387-45528-0\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1214/aos/1176344552\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1093/biomet/63.3.581\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1002/9781119013563\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1111/ecog.02881\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1186/1471-2105-7-91\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1214/09-SS054\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1111/j.2517-6161.1974.tb00994.x\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1093/biomet/30.1-2.81\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.2307/1412159\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1007/s10994-009-5152-4\",\n    \"Exact DOI: 10.1175/1520-0493(1950)078<0001:VOFEIT>2.0.CO;2\"\n{\n  \"schema_name\": \"scientific-evidence.artifact-manifest\",\n  \"artifact\": {\n    \"path\": \"reference_consultation.md\",\n    \"kind\": \"derived\"\n  },\n  \"derived_from\": [\n    \"@evidence[[references_provenance.json]]\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Retrieved abstracts/metadata inspected during drafting.\",\n  \"generated_by\": {\n    \"script_path\": \"retrieve_vetted_references.py\",\n    \"command\": [\n      \"python\",\n      \"retrieve_vetted_references.py\"\n    ]\n  }\n}{\n  \"schema_name\": \"scientific-evidence.artifact-manifest\",\n  \"artifact\": {\n    \"path\": \"paper.pdf\",\n    \"kind\": \"derived\"\n  },\n  \"derived_from\": [\n    \"@evidence[[paper.tex]]\",\n    \"@evidence[[references.bib]]\",\n    \"@evidence[[figure_manifest.json]]\"\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"Direct no-shell-escape pdfLaTeX/BibTeX compilation; see latex-final.log.\"\n}-rw-r--r-- 1 agent agent 24039 Nov 13 18:43 figures/method_and_evidence_overview.png\n-rw-r--r-- 1 agent agent     3 Nov 13 18:26 figures/method_and_evidence_overview.prompts.json\n421:FUNCTION {format.date}\n423:    { \"empty year in \" cite$ * warning$\n610:  month empty$ year empty$ note empty$\n716:      format.date \"year\" output.check\n761:  format.date \"year\" output.check\n779:  format.date output\n818:  format.date \"year\" output.check\n843:      format.date \"year\" output.check\n873:          format.date \"year\" output.check\n876:          format.date \"year\" output.check\n907:  format.date output\n924:  format.date \"year\" output.check\n939:  format.date output\n958:  format.date \"year\" output.check\n974:  format.date \"year\" output.check\n996:  format.date \"year\" output.check\n1011:  format.date output\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
